{"id":"rest-timer-pausa","anfitrion":"lw-superserie","insertar":"main-end","html":"<aside aria-label=\"Temporizador de descanso\" data-testid=\"rest-timer-banner\" class=\"fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-40 overflow-hidden border-t border-border bg-rest-timer pb-[env(safe-area-inset-bottom)] lg:inset-x-auto lg:bottom-6 lg:right-6 lg:w-[400px] lg:rounded-2xl lg:border lg:shadow-m3-2\"><div role=\"progressbar\" aria-label=\"Progreso del descanso\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"90\" aria-valuenow=\"16\" class=\"h-1.5 w-full bg-rest-timer-track\"><div class=\"h-full transition-[width] duration-300 ease-linear motion-reduce:transition-none bg-rest-timer-paused\" style=\"width:17.77777777777778%\"></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-md space-y-3 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-3\"><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-rest-timer-paused\">Pausado</p><p class=\"truncate text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Press banca plano · Serie 2</p></div><div role=\"timer\" aria-live=\"off\" aria-label=\"Quedan 1 minutos y 14 segundos\" class=\"font-mono text-6xl font-black leading-none tracking-tight tabular-nums text-rest-timer-time\">01:14</div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg font-medium transition-all duration-150 select-none touch-manipulation focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 cursor-pointer border bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/60 active:scale-[0.98] h-[var(--button-h-quick)] px-3 rounded-xl text-base font-bold font-mono\" aria-label=\"Restar 30 segundos\">−30 s</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg font-medium transition-all duration-150 select-none touch-manipulation focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 cursor-pointer border bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-muted/60 active:scale-[0.98] h-[var(--button-h-quick)] px-3 rounded-xl text-base font-bold font-mono\" aria-label=\"Sumar 30 segundos\">+30 s</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg font-medium transition-all duration-150 select-none touch-manipulation focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 cursor-pointer bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:brightness-105 active:scale-[0.98] h-[var(--button-h-quick)] px-3 rounded-xl text-base font-bold\" aria-label=\"Reanudar descanso\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" class=\"size-6\"><polygon points=\"6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"none\"></polygon></svg></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg font-medium transition-all duration-150 select-none touch-manipulation focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 cursor-pointer border bg-background text-secondary-foreground hover:bg-secondary/80 active:scale-[0.98] h-[var(--button-h-quick)] px-3 rounded-xl text-base font-bold\">Omitir</button></div></div></aside>"}